1
00:00:01,701 --> 00:00:03,396
I began to learn new things
about Eun-ho

2
00:00:03,397 --> 00:00:05,171
since I started
working alone with him.

3
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:08,666
He quickly fixes any mistakes
and has a great sense for

4
00:00:09,242 --> 00:00:10,543
getting things done.

5
00:00:10,643 --> 00:00:11,878
And above all else...

6
00:00:11,878 --> 00:00:12,878
Here you are.

7
00:00:15,782 --> 00:00:17,384
He's popular

8
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,988
across all groups of people.

9
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,558
You're really popular.

10
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:26,659
How many people
chased after you?

11
00:00:26,659 --> 00:00:28,328
I don't know.
I never counted.

12
00:00:29,229 --> 00:00:30,840
Did you ever try
getting close to any of them?

13
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:32,232
No, never.

14
00:00:33,666 --> 00:00:34,906
But you must have
a type, right?

15
00:00:36,703 --> 00:00:38,783
I don't have a type I like
but I do know what I hate.

16
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:40,407
What is it?

17
00:00:40,407 --> 00:00:42,407
I don't like it when
someone tells me they like me.

18
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:45,045
I find them
unattractive and strange.

19
00:00:46,613 --> 00:00:48,213
So I never reach out to
all those people.

20
00:00:49,282 --> 00:00:50,850
That doesn't sound
very logical.

21
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,252
It's based on my past data.

22
00:00:57,524 --> 00:00:58,958
You're scared, aren't you?

23
00:00:58,958 --> 00:00:59,592
Excuse me?

24
00:00:59,959 --> 00:01:03,296
That's why you
push others away

25
00:01:03,296 --> 00:01:04,664
and belittle yourself.

26
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:07,434
Don't be too hard on yourself.

27
00:01:07,434 --> 00:01:10,170
You're a lot better
than you think.

28
00:01:17,510 --> 00:01:19,512
What am I saying?

29
00:01:19,512 --> 00:01:22,382
He sounded arrogant
but he looked so hurt.

30
00:01:22,382 --> 00:01:23,383
I couldn't help it...

31
00:01:23,383 --> 00:01:24,383
Excuse me?

32
00:01:25,218 --> 00:01:26,219
Oh, yes!
